          "text": "LIANG P'ei-lan 梁佩蘭 (T. 芝五, H. 樂亭), 1632–1708, poet and calligrapher, was a native of Nan-hai, Kwangtung. Although he obtained the chü-jên degree with highest honors in 1657, he did not succeed in taking his chin-shih until 1688, thirty-one years later.",
